I don't have direct exporience of that hardware, but just to check it,
have you tried connecting the laptop to a CRT? If it looks OK there,
then you might have a problem with the LCD not displaying enough
colours. If it's broken on there, you might have the graphics card
configured wrong.

erm - try the XConfigurator or XF86Setup to interactively mod the X
settings.

Paul.


